{"id":"e214576ff8a9409d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-eratosthenes-sieve.md","title":"Eratosthenes Sieve","display":"df-eratosthenes-sieve — Eratosthenes Sieve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-eratosthenes-sieve","aliases":["58-df-eratosthenes-sieve"],"display":"df-eratosthenes-sieve — Eratosthenes Sieve","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-eratosthenes-sieve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-eratosthenes-sieve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-eratosthenes-sieve — Eratosthenes Sieve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md\">../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,N\\in V\">\\(S,N\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Div}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Div}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (整除关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md\">../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (sieve-output relation defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)\\)</span> (compatible set notation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eratosthenes}:\\{N\\in\\omega:2\\le N\\}\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Eratosthenes}:\\{N\\in\\omega:2\\le N\\}\\to V\\)</span>；兼容函数仅在此域上取值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S(S,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(N\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq N\\land\nS=\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid2\\leq n\\leq N\\land\n\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(2\\leq d\\land d^2\\leq n\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Div}(d,n))\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S(S,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(N\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq N\\land\nS=\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid2\\leq n\\leq N\\land\n\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(2\\leq d\\land d^2\\leq n\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Div}(d,n))\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes\\text{-}sieve\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\bigl(N\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq N\\bigr)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)=S\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S(S,N)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes\\text{-}sieve\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\bigl(N\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq N\\bigr)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)=S\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S(S,N)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该集合正是筛去不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqrt N\">\\(\\sqrt N\\)</span> 的素因子倍数后留下的数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(N)=|\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)|\">\\(\\pi(N)=|\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)|\\)</span> 是直接推论。</li>\n<li>Complexity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(N \\log \\log N)\">\\(O(N \\log \\log N)\\)</span> operations.</li>\n<li>Meissel–Lehmer: compute <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(N)\">\\(\\pi(N)\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N^{2/3}\">\\(N^{2/3}\\)</span> time.</li>\n<li>Lagarias–Miller–Odlyzko: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(N / \\log N)\">\\(O(N / \\log N)\\)</span> algorithm for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(N)\">\\(\\pi(N)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Div}\\subseteq V^2$ (整除关系, see [[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Div}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eratosthenes}:\\{N\\in\\omega:2\\le N\\}\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S(S,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(N\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq N\\land\nS=\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid2\\leq n\\leq N\\land\n\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(2\\leq d\\land d^2\\leq n\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Div}(d,n))\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eratosthenes\\text{-}sieve\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\bigl(N\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq N\\bigr)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)=S\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EratosthenesSieve}_S(S,N)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sqrt N","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi(N)=|\\mathrm{Eratosthenes}(N)|","display":false},{"tex":"O(N \\log \\log N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi(N)","display":false},{"tex":"N^{2/3}","display":false},{"tex":"O(N / \\log N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi(N)","display":false}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-491","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-eratosthenes-sieve.md|58-df-eratosthenes-sieve]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["b932045a4446f26a"]}